<h3 data-start=3D"1693" data-end=3D"1747" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1697" data-end=3D"1747">1. Introduction =C3=A0 Flutter et au projet Flutter=
</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"1749" data-end=3D"1781" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1754" data-end=3D"1781">Qu'est-ce que Flutter ?</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"1783" data-end=3D"2113" class=3D"">Flutter est un framewor=
k de d=C3=A9veloppement open-source cr=C3=A9=C3=A9 par Google. Il permet de=
 cr=C3=A9er des applications multiplateformes (Android, iOS, Web, et bureau=
) =C3=A0 partir d=E2=80=99une seule base de code. Flutter utilise le langag=
e de programmation <strong data-start=3D"2017" data-end=3D"2025">Dart</stro=
ng> et se distingue par sa capacit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 cr=C3=A9er des interfaces u=
tilisateur riches et r=C3=A9actives.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"2115" data-end=3D"2151" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2120" data-end=3D"2151">Pourquoi utiliser Flutter ?</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2153" data-end=3D"2644">
<li data-start=3D"2153" data-end=3D"2244" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2155" data-end=3D"2244" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
155" data-end=3D"2188">D=C3=A9veloppement multiplateforme</strong> : Un seu=
l code pour Android, iOS, le Web, et le bureau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2245" data-end=3D"2362" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2247" data-end=3D"2362" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
247" data-end=3D"2271">Performances =C3=A9lev=C3=A9es</strong> : Les applic=
ations Flutter sont compil=C3=A9es nativement, ce qui offre de bonnes perfo=
rmances.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2363" data-end=3D"2520" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2365" data-end=3D"2520" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
365" data-end=3D"2379">Hot reload</strong> : Flutter permet de voir instant=
an=C3=A9ment les modifications dans l=E2=80=99application sans red=C3=A9mar=
rer, ce qui acc=C3=A9l=C3=A8re le processus de d=C3=A9veloppement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2644" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2523" data-end=3D"2644" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
523" data-end=3D"2547">Richesse des widgets</strong> : Flutter propose un l=
arge =C3=A9ventail de widgets pour cr=C3=A9er des interfaces =C3=A9l=C3=A9g=
antes et r=C3=A9actives.</p>
</li>
</ul>
