<h4 data-start=3D"4519" data-end=3D"4550" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4524" data-end=3D"4550">Ajouter une d=C3=A9pendance</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4552" data-end=3D"4763" class=3D"">Les d=C3=A9pendances so=
nt les packages externes dont votre application a besoin pour fonctionner. =
Flutter permet d=E2=80=99ajouter facilement des d=C3=A9pendances =C3=A0 par=
tir de <code data-start=3D"4709" data-end=3D"4718">pub.dev</code>, le regis=
tre de packages de Dart et Flutter.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4765" data-end=3D"4849" class=3D"">Voici comment ajouter u=
ne d=C3=A9pendance =C3=A0 votre projet dans le fichier <code data-start=3D"=
4833" data-end=3D"4847">pubspec.yaml</code> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4851" data-end=3D"5068">
<li data-start=3D"4851" data-end=3D"4990" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4854" data-end=3D"4990" class=3D"">Allez sur <a data-start=
=3D"4864" data-end=3D"4891" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" hre=
f=3D"https://pub.dev/">pub.dev</a> et trouvez le package dont vous avez bes=
oin (par exemple <code data-start=3D"4949" data-end=3D"4955">http</code> po=
ur effectuer des requ=C3=AAtes HTTP).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4991" data-end=3D"5068" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4994" data-end=3D"5068" class=3D"">Copiez la version du pa=
ckage et ajoutez-le sous la section <code data-start=3D"5053" data-end=3D"5=
067">dependencies</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
