491" data-end=3D"5509"><code data-start=3D"5493" data-end=3D"5507">dependen=
cies</code></strong> : Contient les biblioth=C3=A8ques n=C3=A9cessaires au =
bon fonctionnement de l=E2=80=99application pendant l=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cutio=
n. Par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5624" data-end=3D"5634">provider</code>=
, <code data-start=3D"5636" data-end=3D"5642">http</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"5644" data-end=3D"5659">firebase_core</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5669" data-end=3D"5894" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5671" data-end=3D"5894" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
