=C3=A9es comme <strong data-start=3D"1777" data-end=3D"1785">List</strong>,=
 <strong data-start=3D"1787" data-end=3D"1794">Set</strong>, et <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1799" data-end=3D"1806">Map</strong> qui permettent de stocker d=
es donn=C3=A9es de mani=C3=A8re structur=C3=A9e.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"1869" data-end=3D"1906" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1874" data-end=3D"1906">Types de collections en Dart</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"1908" data-end=3D"1960" class=3D"">Dart propose trois type=
s principaux de collections :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"1962" data-end=3D"2204">
<li data-start=3D"1962" data-end=3D"2043" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1965" data-end=3D"2043" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
965" data-end=3D"1973">List</strong> : Une liste ordonn=C3=A9e d'=C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ments. Les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments peuvent =C3=AAtre dupliqu=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2044" data-end=3D"2128" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2047" data-end=3D"2128" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
047" data-end=3D"2054">Set</strong> : Un ensemble non ordonn=C3=A9 d'=C3=A9=
l=C3=A9ments uniques. Les doublons sont =C3=A9limin=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2129" data-end=3D"2204" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2132" data-end=3D"2204" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
132" data-end=3D"2139">Map</strong> : Une collection de paires cl=C3=A9-val=
eur, o=C3=B9 chaque cl=C3=A9 est unique.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2206" data-end=3D"2209" class=3D"">
