<ul data-start=3D"3111" data-end=3D"3386">
<li data-start=3D"3111" data-end=3D"3162" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3113" data-end=3D"3162" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"311=
3" data-end=3D"3120">add()</code> : Ajoute un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment =C3=A0 la f=
