<h4 data-start=3D"4202" data-end=3D"4264" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4207" data-end=3D"4264">Gestion des exceptions avec <code data-start=3D"423=
7" data-end=3D"4242">try</code>, <code data-start=3D"4244" data-end=3D"4251=
">catch</code>, <code data-start=3D"4253" data-end=3D"4262">finally</code><=
/strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4266" data-end=3D"4371" class=3D"">La gestion des exceptio=
ns en Dart se fait principalement =C3=A0 l'aide des blocs <code data-start=
=3D"4342" data-end=3D"4347">try</code>, <code data-start=3D"4349" data-end=
=3D"4356">catch</code> et <code data-start=3D"4360" data-end=3D"4369">final=
ly</code> :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4373" data-end=3D"4715">
<li data-start=3D"4373" data-end=3D"4459" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4376" data-end=3D"4459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
376" data-end=3D"4385"><code data-start=3D"4378" data-end=3D"4383">try</cod=
e></strong> : Ce bloc contient le code qui peut potentiellement lancer une =
exception.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4460" data-end=3D"4530" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4463" data-end=3D"4530" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
463" data-end=3D"4474"><code data-start=3D"4465" data-end=3D"4472">catch</c=
ode></strong> : Ce bloc capture l'exception lanc=C3=A9e par le bloc <code d=
ata-start=3D"4524" data-end=3D"4529">try</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4531" data-end=3D"4715" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4534" data-end=3D"4715" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
534" data-end=3D"4547"><code data-start=3D"4536" data-end=3D"4545">finally<=
/code></strong> : Ce bloc s'ex=C3=A9cute toujours, que l'exception soit lev=
=C3=A9e ou non. Il est utile pour le nettoyage (par exemple, la fermeture d=
e fichiers ou la lib=C3=A9ration de ressources).</p>
</li>
</ol>
