<li data-start=3D"6835" data-end=3D"6910" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6837" data-end=3D"6910" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
837" data-end=3D"6849">Flexible</strong> : Permet de sp=C3=A9cifier une pro=
portion de l=E2=80=99espace disponible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
