<h4 data-start=3D"7229" data-end=3D"7263" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7234" data-end=3D"7263">G=C3=A9rer des =C3=A9tats complexes</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"7265" data-end=3D"7569" class=3D"">Lorsqu'un =C3=A9tat dev=
