<h2 data-start=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2582" class=3D"">1. <strong data-start=
=3D"2537" data-end=3D"2582">Introduction =C3=A0 la navigation dans Flutter<=
/strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2634" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2588" data-end=3D"2634">Qu'est-ce que la navigation dans Flutter ?</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"3009" class=3D"">La navigation dans Flut=
ter est le m=C3=A9canisme qui permet =C3=A0 un utilisateur de passer d=E2=
=80=99un =C3=A9cran (ou vue) =C3=A0 un autre au sein de l=E2=80=99applicati=
on. Flutter offre un syst=C3=A8me de gestion de la navigation qui est bas=
=C3=A9 sur une <strong data-start=3D"2849" data-end=3D"2857">pile</strong> =
d'=C3=A9crans. L'=C3=A9cran principal est =C3=A0 la base de cette pile et, =
au fur et =C3=A0 mesure que l'utilisateur navigue, de nouveaux =C3=A9crans =
sont ajout=C3=A9s =C3=A0 cette pile.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3011" data-end=3D"3053" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3015" data-end=3D"3053">Diff=C3=A9rentes m=C3=A9thodes de navigation</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3055" data-end=3D"3272" class=3D"">Flutter propose plusieu=
rs types de navigation, allant de la navigation simple entre deux =C3=A9cra=
ns =C3=A0 des syst=C3=A8mes plus complexes avec des routes nomm=C3=A9es ou =
la gestion de l'=C3=A9tat de navigation =C3=A0 travers des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3257" data-end=3D"3271">GlobalKeys</strong>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3274" data-end=3D"3592">
<li data-start=3D"3274" data-end=3D"3353" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3276" data-end=3D"3353" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
276" data-end=3D"3298">Navigation de base</strong> : Utilisation du <code d=
ata-start=3D"3316" data-end=3D"3327">Navigator</code> avec <code data-start=
=3D"3333" data-end=3D"3341">push()</code> et <code data-start=3D"3345" data=
-end=3D"3352">pop()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3354" data-end=3D"3454" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3356" data-end=3D"3454" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
356" data-end=3D"3377">Navigation nomm=C3=A9e</strong> : Utilisation de rou=
tes nomm=C3=A9es pour naviguer facilement dans l=E2=80=99application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3455" data-end=3D"3592" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3457" data-end=3D"3592" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
457" data-end=3D"3487">Gestion avanc=C3=A9e de la pile</strong> : Manipuler=
 la pile de navigation en arri=C3=A8re, ou nettoyer la pile en naviguant ve=
rs un =C3=A9cran sp=C3=A9cifique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3594" data-end=3D"3657" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3598" data-end=3D"3657">Pourquoi est-ce important de bien g=C3=A9rer la nav=
igation ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3659" data-end=3D"3704" class=3D"">Une bonne gestion de la=
 navigation garantit :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3991">
<li data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3759" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3707" data-end=3D"3759" class=3D"">Une transition fluide e=
t naturelle entre les =C3=A9crans.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3837" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3762" data-end=3D"3837" class=3D"">La possibilit=C3=A9 de =
revenir en arri=C3=A8re =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dent san=
s complication.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3899" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3840" data-end=3D"3899" class=3D"">Un contr=C3=B4le total =
sur les donn=C3=A9es pass=C3=A9es entre les =C3=A9crans.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3900" data-end=3D"3991" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3902" data-end=3D"3991" class=3D"">Un acc=C3=A8s facile =
=C3=A0 des =C3=A9crans sp=C3=A9cifiques tout en maintenant la pile de navig=
ation propre.</p>
</li>
</ul>
