<hr data-start=3D"10334" data-end=3D"10337" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"10339" data-end=3D"10380" class=3D"">10. <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"10346" data-end=3D"10380">Conclusion et bonnes pratiques</strong></h2=
>
<p data-start=3D"10382" data-end=3D"10557" class=3D"">Comprendre et ma=C3=
=AEtriser la gestion de la pile de navigation dans Flutter est crucial pour=
 cr=C3=A9er des applications bien structur=C3=A9es et fluides. Voici quelqu=
es bonnes pratiques :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"10558" data-end=3D"11010">
<li data-start=3D"10558" data-end=3D"10663" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10560" data-end=3D"10663" class=3D"">Utilisez <strong data=
-start=3D"10569" data-end=3D"10590"><code data-start=3D"10571" data-end=3D"=
10588">Navigator.pop()</code></strong> pour revenir en arri=C3=A8re et <str=
ong data-start=3D"10618" data-end=3D"10630"><code data-start=3D"10620" data=
-end=3D"10628">push()</code></strong> pour empiler de nouveaux =C3=A9crans.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10664" data-end=3D"10757" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10666" data-end=3D"10757" class=3D"">G=C3=A9rez les <stron=
g data-start=3D"10676" data-end=3D"10694">routes nomm=C3=A9es</strong> pour=
 simplifier la navigation dans des applications complexes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10758" data-end=3D"10874" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10760" data-end=3D"10874" class=3D"">Soyez attentif =C3=A0=
 l'utilisation de <strong data-start=3D"10794" data-end=3D"10825"><code dat=
a-start=3D"10796" data-end=3D"10823">GlobalKey&lt;NavigatorState&gt;</code>=
</strong> pour avoir un contr=C3=B4le global sur la navigation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10875" data-end=3D"11010" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10877" data-end=3D"11010" class=3D"">Utilisez des m=C3=A9t=
hodes comme <strong data-start=3D"10905" data-end=3D"10928"><code data-star=
t=3D"10907" data-end=3D"10926">pushReplacement()</code></strong>, <strong d=
ata-start=3D"10930" data-end=3D"10946"><code data-start=3D"10932" data-end=
=3D"10944">popUntil()</code></strong>, et <strong data-start=3D"10951" data=
-end=3D"10977"><code data-start=3D"10953" data-end=3D"10975">pushAndRemoveU=
ntil()</code></strong> pour des sc=C3=A9narios plus avanc=C3=A9s.</p>
