<h3 data-start=3D"4112" data-end=3D"4162" class=3D"">Diff=C3=A9rences entre=
 <code data-start=3D"4134" data-end=3D"4142">Future</code>, <code data-star=
t=3D"4144" data-end=3D"4151">async</code> et <code data-start=3D"4155" data=
-end=3D"4162">await</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4164" data-end=3D"4540">
<li data-start=3D"4164" data-end=3D"4263" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4166" data-end=3D"4263" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
166" data-end=3D"4178"><code data-start=3D"4168" data-end=3D"4176">Future</=
code></strong> : C=E2=80=99est une abstraction pour une valeur qui ne sera =
disponible qu'=C3=A0 un moment futur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4264" data-end=3D"4366" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4266" data-end=3D"4366" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
266" data-end=3D"4277"><code data-start=3D"4268" data-end=3D"4275">async</c=
ode></strong> : Marque une fonction comme asynchrone et permet l=E2=80=99ut=
ilisation de <code data-start=3D"4344" data-end=3D"4351">await</code> =C3=
=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9rieur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4367" data-end=3D"4540" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4369" data-end=3D"4540" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
369" data-end=3D"4380"><code data-start=3D"4371" data-end=3D"4378">await</c=
ode></strong> : Attend la r=C3=A9solution d=E2=80=99un <code data-start=3D"=
4409" data-end=3D"4417">Future</code>. Cela permet de suspens la fonction j=
usqu'=C3=A0 ce que la valeur soit disponible sans bloquer l'ex=C3=A9cution =
du thread principal.</p>
</li>
</ul>
