<h3 data-start=3D"5014" data-end=3D"5034" class=3D"">Types de donn=C3=A9es<=
/h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5036" data-end=3D"5500">
<li data-start=3D"5036" data-end=3D"5166" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5039" data-end=3D"5166" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
039" data-end=3D"5050">Scalars</strong> : Ce sont les types de base. GraphQ=
L fournit des types scalaires comme <code data-start=3D"5122" data-end=3D"5=
127">Int</code>, <code data-start=3D"5129" data-end=3D"5137">String</code>,=
 <code data-start=3D"5139" data-end=3D"5148">Boolean</code>, <code data-sta=
rt=3D"5150" data-end=3D"5157">Float</code> et <code data-start=3D"5161" dat=
a-end=3D"5165">ID</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5167" data-end=3D"5267" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5170" data-end=3D"5267" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
170" data-end=3D"5186">Object Types</strong> : Ce sont des types complexes =
d=C3=A9finis par des objets, comme <code data-start=3D"5247" data-end=3D"52=
53">User</code>, <code data-start=3D"5255" data-end=3D"5261">Post</code>, e=
tc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5268" data-end=3D"5339" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5271" data-end=3D"5339" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
271" data-end=3D"5280">Enums</strong> : Permet de sp=C3=A9cifier des valeur=
s possibles pour un champ.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5340" data-end=3D"5416" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5343" data-end=3D"5416" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
343" data-end=3D"5357">Interfaces</strong> : D=C3=A9finissent des objets qu=
i partagent des champs communs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5417" data-end=3D"5500" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5420" data-end=3D"5500" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
420" data-end=3D"5435">Union Types</strong> : Permet de sp=C3=A9cifier un c=
hamp qui peut =C3=AAtre de plusieurs types.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5502" data-end=3D"5541" class=3D"">Queries, Mutations et =
Subscriptions</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5543" data-end=3D"5778">
<li data-start=3D"5543" data-end=3D"5595" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5545" data-end=3D"5595" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
545" data-end=3D"5556">Queries</strong> : Requ=C3=AAtes pour r=C3=A9cup=C3=
=A9rer des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5596" data-end=3D"5669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5598" data-end=3D"5669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
598" data-end=3D"5611">Mutations</strong> : Requ=C3=AAtes pour cr=C3=A9er, =
modifier ou supprimer des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5670" data-end=3D"5778" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5672" data-end=3D"5778" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
672" data-end=3D"5689">Subscriptions</strong> : Abonnements pour recevoir d=
es mises =C3=A0 jour en temps r=C3=A9el lorsque des donn=C3=A9es changent.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
