<h3 data-start=3D"3763" data-end=3D"3808" class=3D"">Comment il g=C3=A8re l=
es d=C3=A9pendances Flutter ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3810" data-end=3D"4141" class=3D"">Dans le fichier <code d=
ata-start=3D"3826" data-end=3D"3840">pubspec.yaml</code>, la section <stron=
g data-start=3D"3853" data-end=3D"3871"><code data-start=3D"3855" data-end=
=3D"3869">dependencies</code></strong> contient toutes les biblioth=C3=A8qu=
es ou plugins dont votre projet a besoin pour fonctionner. La section <stro=
ng data-start=3D"3973" data-end=3D"3995"><code data-start=3D"3975" data-end=
=3D"3993">dev_dependencies</code></strong> est utilis=C3=A9e pour les d=C3=
=A9pendances qui sont n=C3=A9cessaires uniquement pour le d=C3=A9veloppemen=
t ou les tests, mais pas pour l'ex=C3=A9cution de l'application.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4143" data-end=3D"4146" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4148" data-end=3D"4198" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"4154" data-end=3D"4198">Ajouter des d=C3=A9pendances externes simples</=
strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4200" data-end=3D"4248" class=3D"">Ajouter une d=C3=A9pen=
dance =C3=A0 partir de <code data-start=3D"4239" data-end=3D"4248">pub.dev<=
/code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4250" data-end=3D"4513" class=3D"">La plateforme <strong d=
ata-start=3D"4264" data-end=3D"4275">pub.dev</strong> est le r=C3=A9pertoir=
e officiel des packages Flutter. Pour ajouter une d=C3=A9pendance, vous pou=
vez simplement aller sur <strong data-start=3D"4387" data-end=3D"4417"><a d=
ata-start=3D"4389" data-end=3D"4415" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=
=3D"" href=3D"https://pub.dev/">pub.dev</a></strong>, chercher le package q=
ue vous souhaitez ajouter, puis l'ajouter =C3=A0 votre fichier <code data-s=
tart=3D"4498" data-end=3D"4512">pubspec.yaml</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4515" data-end=3D"4598" class=3D"">Par exemple, pour ajout=
er le package <strong data-start=3D"4552" data-end=3D"4562"><code data-star=
t=3D"4554" data-end=3D"4560">http</code></strong> pour la gestion des requ=
=C3=AAtes HTTP :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4600" data-end=3D"4789">
<li data-start=3D"4600" data-end=3D"4706" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4603" data-end=3D"4706" class=3D"">Allez sur <strong data-=
start=3D"4613" data-end=3D"4657"><a data-start=3D"4615" data-end=3D"4655" r=
el=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"cursor-pointer">pub.dev</a></stron=
g> et copiez la derni=C3=A8re version stable du package.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4707" data-end=3D"4789" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4710" data-end=3D"4789" class=3D"">Ajoutez-le dans la sect=
ion <strong data-start=3D"4737" data-end=3D"4755"><code data-start=3D"4739"=
 data-end=3D"4753">dependencies</code></strong> de votre fichier <code data=
-start=3D"4773" data-end=3D"4787">pubspec.yaml</code> :</p>
</li>
</ol>
