<h3 data-start=3D"5275" data-end=3D"5327" class=3D"">Mettre =C3=A0 jour et =
g=C3=A9rer les versions des packages</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5329" data-end=3D"5513" class=3D"">Pour mettre =C3=A0 jour=
