rt=3D"5408" data-end=3D"5422">pubspec.yaml</code> et d'ex=C3=A9cuter la com=
mande <code data-start=3D"5449" data-end=3D"5466">flutter pub get</code> po=
ur r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer la derni=C3=A8re version du package.</p>
