<hr data-start=3D"5163" data-end=3D"5166" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5168" data-end=3D"5209" class=3D"">3. <strong data-start=
=3D"5174" data-end=3D"5209">L'interface de Flutter DevTools</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"5211" data-end=3D"5270" class=3D"">L'interface de DevTools=
 est divis=C3=A9e en plusieurs sections :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5272" data-end=3D"5985">
