<li data-start=3D"3244" data-end=3D"3372" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3247" data-end=3D"3372" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
247" data-end=3D"3270">Probl=C3=A8mes de r=C3=A9seau</strong> : R=C3=A9seau=
 lent ou mauvais design des appels API entra=C3=AEnant un retard dans la r=
=C3=A9cup=C3=A9ration des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
