r la performance</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9528" data-end=3D"9577" class=3D"">Techniques de r=C3=A9d=
uction du temps de d=C3=A9marrage</h3>
<p data-start=3D"9579" data-end=3D"9722" class=3D"">Le temps de d=C3=A9marr=
