<li data-start=3D"510" data-end=3D"797" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"513" data-end=3D"797" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"513=
" data-end=3D"551">Abstraction des sources de donn=C3=A9es</strong> : Les r=
